  message: "[REVIEW 2026-11-15: REAL TODAY, TEXT ACCURATE] 2026-11-15, dev e2b6ab8096, read-only check; smart-test and the replay not run. Code facts hold: `_ImportCollector` descends into functions; conftest.py:57 (fixture) -> `hypergumbo_core/__init__.py`:81 -> ir.py:972/2161 (in functions) -> catalog.py:788 (in a function) -> cli. The lab files exist and variants_out.txt holds the quoted figures. By a static call of import_closure on today's tree: 1423 test files (1414 at 2b669a5414); schema.py closure 1423 shipped, 314 under the variant; test_stable_shape_ids.py in both. On the bed tree the variant's closure of limits.py has 4 test files and lacks test_reads_lazily.py, as the item expects. ADR-0010:316 and the module docstring still say 18%. No commit to import_closure.py since 4a7fb7b6b0. Full review: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/reports/WI-nusil.md. No status or priority change made by this review."  # d585
